    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Trie</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Design</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/implement-trie-prefix-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 208</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Implement Trie (Prefix Tree)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Store words letter by letter on a shared path, so a prefix query is a walk of its own length, no matter how many words are stored. search and startsWith do the same walk and differ only in the last check: \"is a word-end flag set here?\". O(L) per call, O(total letters) memory.</p>\n"
